                                     'Function10068AC0 setsid0/metadata0,constructsCCmdString,detailList0; '
                                     'detail10068A30 setsid0/additionList0; addition10068920 setsid0/value0.',
                                     'List RemoveAll follows actual head-linked nodes untilnull (not count), '
